{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40358","headline":"观修处士画桃花图歌 · 裴谐","name":"观修处士画桃花图歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一从天宝王维死，于今始遇修夫子。\n能向鲛绡四幅中，丹青暗与春争工。\n勾芒若见应羞杀，晕绿匀红渐分别。\n堪怜彩笔似东风，一朵一枝随手发。\n燕支乍湿如含露，引得娇莺痴不去。\n多少游蜂尽日飞，看遍花心求入处。\n工夫妙丽实奇绝，似对韶光好时节。\n偏宜留着待深冬，铺向楼前殛霜雪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"裴谐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}